    "module_designation": "Non-automatic weighing indicator",
    "description": "Non-automatic weighing indicator for single-interval, multi-interval (up to 3 intervals) and multi-range (up to 3 ranges) applications. Devices include semi-automatic zero-setting, automatic zero-tracking, initial zero-setting, semi-automatic subtractive tare, semi-automatic tare, automatic tare, auto-clear tare, preset tare, temporary gross indication, extended resolution, optional check weighing, inbound/outbound weighbridge weighing, external and automatic printing, and optional classifying, filling, packing, calculated volume, alibi memory, tilt switch input, piece counting and gravity compensation. Interfaces: RS-232, RS-485; optional digital input/outputs or analogue outputs; optional Modbus RTU, Modbus TCP, Ethernet, Profinet, Profinet S2, Profibus, CANopen, EtherNet/IP, EtherCAT, CC-Link, Powerlink, IoT, CC-Link IE; optional Bluetooth or WiFi. Software format XX.YY, where XX is the revision of the legally relevant functionality and YY is the sub-revision number."
